@startuml
title app Savepoint状態図
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #9E9E9E
skinparam ArrowColor #455A64
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #455A64

[*] --> ACTIVE : SAVEPOINT成功

ACTIVE --> BROKEN : rollback開始
BROKEN --> ROLLED_BACK : ROLLBACK TO成功
BROKEN --> [*] : ROLLBACK TO失敗\nFailureRollbackException

ACTIVE --> BROKEN : release開始
ROLLED_BACK --> BROKEN : release開始
BROKEN --> RELEASED : RELEASE成功
BROKEN --> [*] : RELEASE失敗\nFailureReleaseException

RELEASED --> [*]
ROLLED_BACK --> RELEASED : close()
ACTIVE --> RELEASED : close()

note right of BROKEN
管理SQL実行前にBROKENへ遷移。
失敗後に誤って再解放しない。
end note

@enduml
